{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127083900427-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127085345\"/><p>案發在沙頭角公路－龍躍頭段。</p><p>上水發生縱火案。今日(27日)凌晨1時12分，有途人報案，指沙頭角公路－龍躍頭段一挖泥機起火。消防接報到場將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。經初步調查相信，起火原因有可疑，案件列作「縱火」處理，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:03:52.155596+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T00:57:26.843785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:57:26.843785+00:00","content_hash":"f670878672f9acda432fc444b94b752e5b91dd165308182ae3af01488dbe7c65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}